WEBVTT

00:23.840 --> 00:28.839
(Based on Softstar Technology
single-player game "Chinese Paladin 3")

00:28.840 --> 00:35.359
(Copyright Notice)

00:35.360 --> 00:36.879
(Viewers under the age of majority
should watch with guardian permission.)

00:36.880 --> 00:38.689
(The content depicted in this film
is fictional.)

00:38.690 --> 00:40.520
(Do not imitate in real life.)

00:58.820 --> 01:01.789
♪Blades of wind cut through dark clouds,
sunset flares to life♪

01:01.790 --> 01:04.060
♪Staining the vast sky red♪

01:04.550 --> 01:09.720
♪A fierce spirit forges a sacred sword,
unafraid of demons♪

01:10.300 --> 01:13.089
♪Breaking the heavens,
shattering the shrouded dark♪

01:13.090 --> 01:15.959
♪Breaking the dream,
thorns blinding the way♪

01:15.960 --> 01:18.379
♪Breaking love,
trapped in hatred and obsession♪

01:18.380 --> 01:21.129
♪The sword's edge ignites
with burning blood♪

01:21.130 --> 01:24.109
♪Fight to the fullest♪

01:24.110 --> 01:26.899
♪Burn to the fullest♪

01:26.900 --> 01:29.689
♪For the one I love♪

01:29.690 --> 01:32.439
♪No regrets whether laughter or tears♪

01:32.440 --> 01:35.239
♪I never stop searching♪

01:35.240 --> 01:38.460
♪I never stop falling♪

01:41.020 --> 01:44.130
♪A furious roar shakes the earth
and pierces the sky♪

01:53.760 --> 01:56.799
=Sword and Fairy 3=

01:56.800 --> 01:59.040
=Episode 7=
=The Monkey Demon Jingjing=

02:12.100 --> 02:14.259
She is actually a demon.

02:14.260 --> 02:15.180
Stop.

02:21.180 --> 02:22.100
Dear.

02:22.770 --> 02:24.580
So she turns out to be a demon
that harms people.

02:32.580 --> 02:34.500
Still trying to hurt others?
Put him down now.

02:36.740 --> 02:38.620
Listen to my explanation.

02:51.860 --> 02:52.780
How could this be?

02:53.220 --> 02:54.300
Do not even think of running.

02:54.340 --> 02:55.420
Xuejian.

02:57.180 --> 02:58.420
Go.

03:02.220 --> 03:04.059
Something is not right. Be careful.

03:04.060 --> 03:05.979
I have no grudge with either of you,

03:05.980 --> 03:08.019
yet you keep forcing me again and again.

03:08.020 --> 03:09.380
Since that is the case,

03:09.540 --> 03:11.980
do not blame me for showing no mercy.

03:13.660 --> 03:14.339
Xue...

03:14.340 --> 03:15.139
Xuejian.

03:15.140 --> 03:16.140
Are you all right?

03:18.860 --> 03:20.060
What are you doing?

03:20.620 --> 03:21.419
Xuejian.

03:21.420 --> 03:23.220
I... I am Jing Tian.

03:26.900 --> 03:27.879
Xuejian.

03:27.879 --> 03:30.000
Do not panic. There is something
strange about this fog.

03:32.340 --> 03:33.860
It is good that you are unharmed.

03:34.090 --> 03:35.339
Be careful.

03:35.340 --> 03:36.620
Do not fall for her tricks.

03:36.820 --> 03:38.740
All of this is her deception.

03:39.100 --> 03:40.460
Zi Xuan.

03:47.880 --> 03:50.020
You demon are truly vicious.

03:50.540 --> 03:52.919
Not only did you use your own husband
to cultivate demon arts,

03:52.920 --> 03:54.900
you even tried to kill us
with dark techniques.

03:56.130 --> 03:58.300
Have I truly harmed any of you?

03:59.580 --> 04:00.860
For thousands of years,

04:01.380 --> 04:02.409
let alone humans,

04:02.410 --> 04:03.859
even birds and beasts,

04:03.860 --> 04:05.699
or flowers and plants,

04:05.700 --> 04:07.579
I have never harmed a single one.

04:07.580 --> 04:08.960
But just now,

04:08.980 --> 04:11.420
you clearly turned
your own husband into a clay figurine.

04:11.900 --> 04:13.699
I was trying to save him.

04:13.700 --> 04:15.060
For the past three years,

04:15.180 --> 04:17.820
I have been using this technique
to slow his illness.

04:18.140 --> 04:20.860
Now I have even damaged
my own cultivation to keep him alive.

04:21.320 --> 04:23.320
(Wan Yuzhi's husband)
Yet his condition kept worsening,

04:23.320 --> 04:24.700
and his days were numbered.

04:24.780 --> 04:26.340
I had already lost all hope.

04:26.780 --> 04:28.259
After he died,

04:28.260 --> 04:30.700
I meant to turn
to dust together with him.

04:31.380 --> 04:33.340
But you happened to discover us.

04:34.460 --> 04:35.940
Was this fate?

04:36.940 --> 04:38.180
Very well.

04:38.380 --> 04:39.860
Then kill me.

04:40.060 --> 04:43.100
Let me wait for him beneath the earth.

04:44.140 --> 04:45.739
I can sense it.

04:45.740 --> 04:47.199
Although you are a flower demon,

04:47.200 --> 04:48.900
you have no intention of harming anyone.

04:48.980 --> 04:51.100
You should explain everything clearly.

04:51.260 --> 04:52.460
Perhaps,

04:52.570 --> 04:54.060
we can help you.

05:00.820 --> 05:03.380
I was originally a jade-branch azalea.

05:04.980 --> 05:06.420
Over countless years,

05:07.300 --> 05:09.220
I absorbed the essence
of heaven and earth,

05:10.260 --> 05:12.140
and finally cultivated a human form.

05:13.100 --> 05:14.700
On that day,

05:14.990 --> 05:16.140
I came to realize

05:16.900 --> 05:18.940
that I could feel mortal love.

05:21.580 --> 05:22.660
Not long after,

05:23.220 --> 05:25.500
the two of us vowed
to spend our lives together.

05:26.540 --> 05:28.059
Our home

05:28.060 --> 05:30.020
was built in this mountain valley,

05:30.060 --> 05:31.740
among the flowers.

05:33.610 --> 05:37.179
But one day, he went to gather herbs
in the Ancient Vine Forest

05:37.180 --> 05:38.780
and slipped, falling down.

05:39.340 --> 05:41.739
Not only were his
internal organs badly injured,

05:41.740 --> 05:42.459
it seemed

05:42.460 --> 05:44.660
he had also been afflicted
with a strange poison.

05:45.360 --> 05:48.380
I tried to heal him with a spirit pearl
I gained through cultivation.

05:49.220 --> 05:50.579
Little by little,

05:50.580 --> 05:52.500
he recovered some vitality.

05:53.380 --> 05:54.819
But not long ago,

05:54.820 --> 05:57.620
the spirit pearl was stolen.

05:58.220 --> 05:59.660
With no other choice,

05:59.980 --> 06:02.099
I could only damage
my cultivation as before,

06:02.100 --> 06:04.019
forcing his life to continue.

06:04.020 --> 06:06.260
Yet he is still slowly dying.

06:06.980 --> 06:08.900
My spiritual power is nearly exhausted.

06:09.220 --> 06:10.779
If I still cannot save him,

06:10.780 --> 06:12.940
then I will turn
to dust together with him.

06:13.040 --> 06:16.420
I am sorry. We misunderstood you.

06:16.820 --> 06:19.500
Hua Ying, can you detoxify him?

06:24.180 --> 06:26.460
This is an evil miasma
called poison miasma.

06:27.060 --> 06:29.780
It often forms deep in remote,
uninhabited mountains.

06:30.100 --> 06:31.499
However, this kind of evil energy

06:31.500 --> 06:33.339
can be restrained by earth energy.

06:33.340 --> 06:35.059
The spirit pearl you lost

06:35.060 --> 06:36.859
should be the Earth Spirit Pearl.

06:36.860 --> 06:38.939
As long as we recover
that Earth Spirit Pearl,

06:38.940 --> 06:40.419
and I apply my arts,

06:40.420 --> 06:41.900
awakening its spiritual power,

06:42.060 --> 06:44.739
we can completely cure
the poison miasma in your husband.

06:44.740 --> 06:45.780
Truly?

06:47.460 --> 06:49.979
If you are willing to help me retrieve
the Earth Spirit Pearl,

06:49.980 --> 06:53.340
I am willing to offer my thousand years
of cultivation as repayment.

06:54.340 --> 06:57.100
A thousand years of cultivation
in exchange for a hundred years of life.

06:57.140 --> 06:58.580
Is it worth it?

07:00.580 --> 07:02.460
If he were gone,

07:02.940 --> 07:05.260
then even living another thousand years

07:05.460 --> 07:07.220
would be meaningless.

07:07.340 --> 07:08.859
As long as he is still here,

07:08.860 --> 07:10.620
even just one more day

07:10.740 --> 07:13.340
is worth a thousand years of time.

07:13.580 --> 07:15.139
Zi Xuan,

07:15.140 --> 07:17.180
then where should we
look for the Earth Spirit Pearl?

07:18.100 --> 07:20.660
Do you know where
the demon aura nearby is strongest?

07:21.660 --> 07:24.980
There is an Ancient Vine Forest
in the valley ahead,

07:25.140 --> 07:26.780
where demon aura lingers all year round.

07:27.320 --> 07:29.840
(Ancient Vine Forest)

07:33.740 --> 07:35.540
This forest is so vast.

07:35.620 --> 07:37.780
How are we supposed
to find a single pearl?

07:38.920 --> 07:40.620
I do not know the exact location,

07:41.290 --> 07:43.140
but the spiritual power
of the Earth Spirit Pearl

07:43.590 --> 07:46.740
is indeed spreading outward
from deep within this forest.

07:47.540 --> 07:48.620
Zi Xuan,

07:48.750 --> 07:51.660
what kind of treasure
is this Earth Spirit Pearl exactly?

07:53.380 --> 07:56.219
The theory of the Five Elements dates
back to Pangu opening the heavens

07:56.220 --> 07:57.580
and Nuwa creating humankind.

07:57.640 --> 07:59.999
The Five Elements refer to the forces contained
between heaven and earth,

07:59.999 --> 08:03.379
wind, thunder, water, fire, and earth,

08:03.380 --> 08:05.140
five fundamental natural powers.

08:05.220 --> 08:06.939
As these elements converge in the world,

08:06.940 --> 08:08.940
they gradually form
the Five Spirit Pearls.

08:09.100 --> 08:11.740
The Earth Spirit Pearl is one of them.

08:13.220 --> 08:14.659
In other words,

08:14.660 --> 08:16.700
there are only
five spirit pearls in existence.

08:16.860 --> 08:19.060
That truly makes it
a priceless treasure.

08:24.220 --> 08:26.660
Is that not my treasured copper coin?

08:27.540 --> 08:29.060
Look, a little monkey.

08:31.160 --> 08:33.459
(Little Monkey, Jingjing)

08:33.460 --> 08:35.419
It was the one
that stole your coin pouch.

08:35.420 --> 08:38.300
You little beast, you dared
steal my precious coin pouch.

08:38.340 --> 08:41.100
You little thief,
just wait until I catch you.

08:50.260 --> 08:51.880
This monkey demon
is no ordinary creature.

08:51.880 --> 08:53.800
It has likely cultivated
for a thousand years already.

08:53.800 --> 08:55.800
The Earth Spirit Pearl
was probably stolen by it.

09:03.460 --> 09:04.740
I have an idea.

09:09.180 --> 09:10.700
I am full.

09:11.220 --> 09:13.819
Too much rice cake
always makes me thirsty.

09:13.820 --> 09:15.540
I will go fetch some water.

09:16.500 --> 09:18.060
Then I will gather firewood.

09:18.940 --> 09:20.660
I will go with you.

09:41.700 --> 09:43.260
Put me down.

09:43.460 --> 09:44.819
My rice cake.

09:44.820 --> 09:46.260
Got you.

09:48.180 --> 09:49.620
Put me down.

09:50.340 --> 09:51.980
Put me down.

09:53.160 --> 09:54.579
- Yuzhi said
- Give the rice cake back.

09:54.580 --> 09:56.459
that thief always steals
the rice cakes she makes.

09:56.460 --> 09:57.539
So I brought some along.

09:57.540 --> 09:59.059
They came in handy after all.

09:59.060 --> 10:00.659
Put me down right now.

10:00.660 --> 10:02.059
If I get angry,

10:02.060 --> 10:03.900
the consequences will be serious.

10:03.940 --> 10:04.819
Give me the rice cake.

10:04.820 --> 10:06.449
So your name is Jingjing.

10:06.450 --> 10:08.219
- You really like rice cake.
- Let go of me.

10:08.220 --> 10:09.019
Rice cake.

10:09.020 --> 10:11.019
Too bad, you are far too wicked.

10:11.020 --> 10:12.820
This is not for you.

10:38.360 --> 10:40.920
This... This is
the little monkey from earlier.

10:58.380 --> 10:59.460
Jing Tian!

11:08.020 --> 11:10.420
- Jing Tian, are you all right?
- Tian.

11:25.500 --> 11:27.140
Zi Xuan.

11:31.260 --> 11:32.700
This cannot go on.

11:32.970 --> 11:35.539
Most demons are vulnerable
at the Yifeng acupoint. Try there.

11:35.540 --> 11:36.420
All right.

11:41.020 --> 11:42.099
You filthy monkey.

11:42.100 --> 11:43.179
I'm right here.

11:43.180 --> 11:44.460
Come over here if you dare.

11:58.060 --> 11:59.580
Xuejian, get up here, now.

12:08.300 --> 12:09.820
This is the place.

12:30.420 --> 12:31.660
Xuejian!

12:58.260 --> 13:01.140
You demon monkey. You stole something
and still dare to attack people.

13:01.820 --> 13:05.340
Did you steal the spirit pearl
that keeps Wan Yuzhi and her husband alive?

13:06.770 --> 13:08.240
What are you talking about?

13:08.940 --> 13:10.840
That couple in the azalea grove
of Anning Village.

13:10.840 --> 13:12.440
The husband was struck
by a strange poison.

13:12.440 --> 13:13.990
He survived only because
of the Earth Spirit Pearl.

13:14.060 --> 13:15.500
Then the pearl was stolen.

13:15.540 --> 13:18.139
Now Wan Yuzhi can only trade
her own life to sustain her husband.

13:18.140 --> 13:19.899
Where is her pearl now?

13:19.900 --> 13:20.619
Return it at once.

13:20.620 --> 13:23.120
Vine Old Monster said Wan Yuzhi
was not a good person.

13:23.120 --> 13:25.259
He said the Earth Spirit Pearl
belongs to the forest.

13:25.260 --> 13:27.259
He told me to steal it back
and give it to him.

13:27.260 --> 13:29.699
I truly did not know
it was something meant to save a life.

13:29.700 --> 13:32.859
I only wanted to be a righteous thief
like my master.

13:32.860 --> 13:36.100
I meant to steal things,
not to harm anyone.

13:36.140 --> 13:39.579
My master once said
that as a righteous thief,

13:39.580 --> 13:42.779
there are things one must do
and things one must never do.

13:42.780 --> 13:44.639
And above all, one rule matters most.

13:44.639 --> 13:47.019
(Li Hankong)
Never steal anything tied to another person's life.

13:47.020 --> 13:48.139
You must

13:48.140 --> 13:50.700
always remember this.

13:53.780 --> 13:55.219
A righteous thief?

13:55.220 --> 13:57.499
Then how did he teach
such a rotten disciple like you?

13:57.500 --> 13:59.380
Do not speak ill of him.

14:00.420 --> 14:03.219
My master is Li Hankong,
the great thief of Bashu.

14:03.220 --> 14:06.140
A righteous thief
who strikes fear into evildoers.

14:07.860 --> 14:10.020
You little monkey.

14:10.140 --> 14:12.019
Do you even realize
the trouble you have caused?

14:12.020 --> 14:13.139
Little girl,

14:13.140 --> 14:14.699
I'm not a little monkey.

14:14.700 --> 14:16.579
I have lived for hundreds of years.

14:16.580 --> 14:18.019
How rude.

14:18.020 --> 14:21.380
Did your master not teach you
how to speak to a young lady?

14:21.820 --> 14:23.820
Of course my master taught me.

14:23.900 --> 14:28.220
He even passed on his lifelong ultimate skill,
the Flying Dragon Cloud-Stealing Hand.

14:28.340 --> 14:29.739
If you are that capable,

14:29.740 --> 14:31.939
then take us
to retrieve the pearl at once.

14:31.940 --> 14:34.060
Go find that Vine Old Monster.

14:34.180 --> 14:35.899
No.

14:35.900 --> 14:38.900
Vine Old Monster is like a rat,
he burrows underground.

14:39.220 --> 14:41.620
Who knows which hole
he hid the pearl in.

14:42.060 --> 14:45.059
Besides, that fellow has cultivated
for several thousand years.

14:45.060 --> 14:47.099
With a single reach,
his vines can stretch for miles.

14:47.100 --> 14:49.019
Nimbler than any arm.

14:49.020 --> 14:51.860
Ten of you would still
be no match for him.

14:52.100 --> 14:53.500
Do not go looking for him.

14:55.980 --> 14:58.899
It seems truly afraid
of that Vine Old Monster.

14:58.900 --> 14:59.980
Zi Xuan.

15:00.170 --> 15:02.100
Can you still sense
the Earth Spirit Pearl?

15:06.050 --> 15:07.900
It should be just ahead, not far now.

15:08.360 --> 15:09.399
We should not delay.

15:09.400 --> 15:10.500
Let us go on our own.

15:10.980 --> 15:11.940
All right.

15:14.210 --> 15:15.940
Do not go.

15:20.710 --> 15:23.620
By the way, why have we not seen Kui?

15:25.460 --> 15:28.619
Kui was inside the Demon Sword earlier,
teaching me sword techniques.

15:28.620 --> 15:31.289
But she said it drains her greatly.

15:31.290 --> 15:32.750
So she needs to rest for a while.

15:34.420 --> 15:35.900
I see.

15:38.500 --> 15:40.100
What did you learn exactly?

15:40.260 --> 15:41.620
When will you show us?

15:43.700 --> 15:45.979
Jing Tian, what is wrong?

15:45.980 --> 15:47.020
Stop.

15:47.670 --> 15:49.740
My head is starting to spin again.

15:49.870 --> 15:50.950
Tian.

15:51.940 --> 15:53.739
It may be because of the miasma here.

15:53.740 --> 15:55.069
Everyone be careful.

15:55.070 --> 15:56.180
Strange.

15:56.680 --> 15:58.540
Was it not broad daylight just now?

16:10.140 --> 16:12.579
Hua Ying said the miasma here
is far too dense.

16:12.580 --> 16:14.099
It can make people fall unconscious.

16:14.100 --> 16:15.940
Then why am I unaffected?

16:16.140 --> 16:17.379
What about you, Zi Xuan?

16:17.380 --> 16:19.220
I am a cultivator by nature.

16:19.620 --> 16:21.459
You seem to have a special constitution

16:21.460 --> 16:23.100
and appear somewhat immune.

16:38.820 --> 16:40.979
Thank you, Hua Ying. I feel much better.

16:40.980 --> 16:43.940
You absorbed so much miasma.
Hurry and rest.

16:55.380 --> 16:56.930
This is...

16:57.220 --> 16:59.180
It is the mark I left earlier.

16:59.380 --> 17:02.060
Then we have

17:02.340 --> 17:03.820
lost our way?

17:04.820 --> 17:06.000
We are lost?

17:06.580 --> 17:08.580
The deeper we go into this forest,

17:08.660 --> 17:11.100
the harder it becomes for me
to sense the Earth Spirit Pearl.

17:11.860 --> 17:14.420
Someone is deliberately
concealing its aura.

17:15.820 --> 17:17.420
It feels like it is everywhere,

17:17.780 --> 17:19.540
and yet like it is nowhere at all.

17:23.500 --> 17:25.379
Look. What is that?

17:25.380 --> 17:27.379
Those little yellow lights.

17:27.380 --> 17:30.140
Little lights?

17:30.420 --> 17:32.259
I do not see any yellow lights at all.

17:32.260 --> 17:33.420
Xuejian.

17:33.500 --> 17:35.420
Are you seeing things?

17:35.530 --> 17:37.379
So close to the Earth Spirit Pearl,

17:37.380 --> 17:39.900
those lights may not be an illusion.

17:40.680 --> 17:42.819
Xuejian, those are earth spirits.

17:42.820 --> 17:45.420
Earth spirits?

17:45.460 --> 17:47.620
Then why can only I see them?

17:48.880 --> 17:50.500
You have a gift for this.

17:50.660 --> 17:52.340
Xuejian, you lead the way.

17:58.740 --> 18:00.900
This forest really makes one uneasy.

18:01.460 --> 18:02.980
Wait for me.

18:11.200 --> 18:12.479
Unite sword and qi,

18:12.480 --> 18:13.960
ride the sword and soar.

18:14.200 --> 18:15.120
Rise!

18:16.640 --> 18:17.880
It worked!

18:18.880 --> 18:20.040
Jingjing!

18:41.240 --> 18:44.519
♪War flames rise,
the mountains and rivers tremble♪

18:44.520 --> 18:47.839
♪Reincarnation begins,
cause and effect fall into chaos♪

18:47.840 --> 18:51.519
♪The night grows thick, dark as ink♪

18:51.520 --> 18:54.719
♪The wheel of fate starts
to turn backward♪

18:54.720 --> 18:57.879
♪Crimson palace walls,
stained with blood and tears♪

18:57.880 --> 19:01.559
♪Vows scatter with the wind,
fading into the clouds♪

19:01.560 --> 19:05.279
♪Moonlight cannot pierce this darkness♪

19:05.280 --> 19:11.759
♪Who cries out in loneliness
from the abyss♪

19:11.760 --> 19:15.239
♪The net of destiny tightens ever more♪

19:15.240 --> 19:18.719
♪The lock of karma
binds a lifetime unbroken♪

19:18.720 --> 19:22.119
♪Love and hate entwined beyond escape♪

19:22.120 --> 19:25.519
♪Not awaken in a world of chaos♪

19:25.520 --> 19:28.879
♪Stars shatter, heaven and earth mourn♪

19:28.880 --> 19:32.399
♪Snow fills Shu Mountain,
only ruins remain♪

19:32.400 --> 19:35.759
♪Five elements in balance,
six realms side by side♪

19:35.760 --> 19:39.079
♪All for the sake of the living♪

19:39.080 --> 19:43.880
♪Stepping onto a path of no return♪

19:58.520 --> 20:03.819
(Next episode preview)

20:03.820 --> 20:05.019
Help!

20:05.020 --> 20:06.619
Jing Tian, save me!

20:06.620 --> 20:07.299
You all.

20:07.300 --> 20:09.740
Become nourishment for the forest.

20:14.300 --> 20:17.860
See? Do not underestimate me.
I'm a righteous thief.

20:18.660 --> 20:22.140
Wretched beast, you dare betray me.

20:25.580 --> 20:28.380
Blazing Skyfire.
